.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK ATTACHMENT LIST"
.SH NAME
hamstik work attachment list \- List attachments on a work item
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work attachment list [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List attachments on a work item
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --limit
Maximum items per page (endpoint maximum is 100 or 200)
.TP
.B --cursor
Opaque continuation cursor
.TP
.B --all
Follow all pages
Choices: true, false
